  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The Hofmann rule states that the major alkene product is the least substituted and least stable product when it comes to asymmetrical amines.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7a300eb1-c5e0-4262-8589-43153527d18b-image.png\" style=\"width: 451px; height: 140px;\" /></p><p>So, major product will be pent-1-ene and minor product will be pent-2-ene.</p></blockquote>",
